{% macro generate_property_prompt(object_name, categories=None) %}
Please analyze and break down the properties of {{ object_name }} in the following format:

{% if categories is none %}
{% set categories = [
    {
        "name": "Physical Properties",
        "items": ["Dimensions", "Weight", "Materials", "Display specifications"]
    },
    {
        "name": "Technical Specifications",
        "items": ["Processor", "Memory", "Storage", "Battery"]
    },
    {
        "name": "Software Features",
        "items": ["Operating System", "Key Applications", "Security Features"]
    },
    {
        "name": "Connectivity",
        "items": ["Network Capabilities", "Ports", "Wireless Features"]
    }
] %}
{% endif %}

{% for category in categories %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ category.name }}:
{% for item in category.items %}
   - {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

Please provide detailed information for each category and explain how these properties work together to create a cohesive {{ object_name }}.

{% if additional_requirements %}
Additional Requirements:
{{ additional_requirements }}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{# Example usage:
{{ generate_property_prompt("Smartphone") }}
#} 